      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho malaika wa Musengwa Katonda yaava e Giligali, yaaja e Bokimu. Yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Nabatoola mu nsi Misiri, naabaleeta mu nsi ye nasuubiza badhaadha baimwe. Naakoba nti, ‘Tirimenhagho ndagaano ye nakola n'imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mwena naabakoba obutakolanga ndagaano na bantu ababa mu nsi eno mumenhemenhengagho bwa alutaari dhaibwe.’ Aye mukoze ki kino? Timukoze nga bwe nabalagira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.2+DEU.7.3+DEU.7.4+DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 7:2-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mpegaano ndi kubakoba nti tiidha kubingangagho bantu abo nga muli kumpi okutuukagho. Baidha kubanga bazigu baimwe, era mwidha kukemebwanga okusinza emisambwa gyaibwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa Musengwa Katonda bwe yamala okwogera ebyo, Abaisiraeli boonaboona baalira amaziga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekifo ekyo baakituuma eriina Bokimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bokimu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Luheburayi “Bochim”, kitegeeza “Abalizi”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " era baaghaayo emisengo ye Musengwa Katonda nga bali eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
